    <a class="series-card" href="/dragao-onca-bahia.html"><div class="series-card-id">6 · T-237 · Alto</div><div class="series-card-chapter">🇧🇷 BA Bahia</div><div class="series-card-desc">Caso de controle — padrão falha</div></a>
    <a class="series-card" href="/dragao-onca-para.html"><div class="series-card-id">7 · T-230 · Alto</div><div class="series-card-chapter">🇧🇷 PA Pará</div><div class="series-card-desc">Ferrovia + COP30 + 39 mortes</div></a>
